<title>USA: Gum Tech Intl Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Gum Tech Intl Q1 net rises.</headline>
<text>
<p>PHOENIX, Ariz, April 17 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit	$   0.08	 loss  $    0.05</p>
<p> Net profit	   542,000     loss     240,000</p>
<p> Revs		  2,430,000		 891,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Sales increase reflects expansion of distribution network and an agreement with Active Media Services Inc., whereby about $1.5 million of Gum Tech's inventory, including the entire Jack LaLanne line, was sold in exchange for advertising and other barter credits.</p>
</text>
